WEBVTT

00:00:00.300 --> 00:00:02.763
Let’s walk through Strategic Orientation.

00:00:02.763 --> 00:00:06.537
Review the opening position as a complete pre-Move-One artifact.

00:00:06.537 --> 00:00:10.225
Confirm the team, orientation, forecasts, rationale,

00:00:10.225 --> 00:00:13.775
strategy description, expected target actions, and explicit handoff

00:00:13.775 --> 00:00:16.225
state before accepting or returning it.

00:00:16.225 --> 00:00:19.650
On this slide, review each team’s submitted opening orientation

00:00:19.650 --> 00:00:22.538
, target forecasts, and required narrative.

00:00:22.538 --> 00:00:25.275
In practice, confirm the team, completeness, and

00:00:25.275 --> 00:00:28.538
handoff state before accepting or returning the record.

00:00:29.035 --> 00:00:32.685
When you are ready, use Open Strategic Orientation to

00:00:32.685 --> 00:00:34.547
move to the live surface.

00:00:34.547 --> 00:00:37.285
The guide will not make the workflow decision for you

00:00:37.285 --> 00:00:37.435
.
